  "description": "FAMFAD crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H84 Cu4 Ho2 N8 O16 2+,2(Cl1 O4 1-),C1 H4 O1,5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Cu3 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors; Cu4 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors; Cu5 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors; Cu6 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.202-3.265 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.41-102.82°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ho2Cu4(LH)4][ClO4]2·MeOH·5H2O.",
